# The extension is a notice ([WITHDRAWAL-SURFACES]). It ships no checker, so
# these must never appear in the package even if a stale working tree still
# holds them: `bin/` was the bundled `basilisk` binary and `bundled/` was the
# vendored debugger. Belt and braces beside the packaging change itself —
# shipping the type checker again is the one failure that must be impossible.
bin/**
bundled/**
shipwright.json
NOTICES
THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES
RUST-DEPENDENCY-LICENSES
VSCODE-DEPENDENCY-LICENSES
